{"metadata":{"title":"TrackingPlans","symbolKind":"module","externalID":"TrackingPlans","modules":[{"name":"TrackingPlans"}],"role":"collection","roleHeading":"Framework"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Export every event an app tracks as JSON Schema that people and services outside the app can read, and check each change against the plan committed before it."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracking plan is the contract between an app and whoever reads its events: dashboards, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warehouse, a collector, another platform’s client. Each event’s document gives its version,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consent category, properties and their JSON types, which ones every payload holds, and which are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"text":", in a form that needs no Swift to read. Committed beside the events, it puts every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change to them in the pull request as a JSON diff. Its check says which changes break what has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already shipped: payloads from installed app versions that a validating collector would reject,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and stored records the app could no longer decode.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" turns events’ schemas into files: an index, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tracking-plan.json"},{"text":", and for each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event a JSON Schema (draft 2020-12) document and an example payload. The files are values, so the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same schemas give the same bytes on every run and platform, ready to commit for the people and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tools outside the app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Checking compares the plan the events make now with the committed one by what the files mean. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck"},{"type":"text","text":" is a match, a plan that is only out of date, or one with a breaking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"difference: a change that, at the same version, would leave a stored record or an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already-released app’s payload unable to decode or validate. Each "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"},{"type":"text","text":" names"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the event, the property and the change, and says whether it is breaking."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only code compiled against the app’s event types can read their schemas, so the app writes a small"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"executable of its own: a type that conforms to "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand"},{"type":"text","text":", marked "},{"code":"@main","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". It writes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the plan to a directory, or checks it with "},{"code":"check","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". To run the check from the app’s tests instead,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"code":"TrackingPlanTesting","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The schemas usually come from "},{"code":"@Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"code":"EventMacros","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"):"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/init()"},{"type":"text","text":" takes every "},{"code":"@Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the program and the library’s own events, found at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"run time, and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/init(schemas:)"},{"type":"text","text":" takes a list."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The module is a product of its own that "},{"code":"import Traffluent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" leaves out."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import TrackingPlans","import Traffluent","","@Event(name: \"signed_up\")","struct SignedUp {","    var plan: String","}","","let plan = try TrackingPlan()  \/\/ every @Event in the program, and the library's own","let check = plan.check(against: plan.files)  \/\/ .matches","let paths = plan.files.map(\\.path)","\/\/ [\"tracking-plan.json\", ..., \"signed_up.v1.schema.json\", \"signed_up.v1.example.json\"]"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The plan also writes the schemas of an Iglu registry, which a Snowplow pipeline validates events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/igluFiles(vendor:registry:carryingForward:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"). Version N of an event is SchemaVer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"N-0-0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For Iglu Server, a compatible change at the same version is the next addition, ","type":"text"},{"code":"N-0-1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and on, superseding the earlier ones; a static repository doesn’t supersede, so there the export","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refuses it, and so it does a breaking change for either kind: raise the event’s version.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers the executable, the command plugins and the test."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Making a plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/File","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanError"],"anchor":"Making-a-plan"},{"title":"Writing a plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files(carryingForward:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/write(to:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand"],"anchor":"Writing-a-plan"},{"title":"Exporting an Iglu registry","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/igluFiles(vendor:registry:carryingForward:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluRegistry","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError"],"anchor":"Exporting-an-Iglu-registry"},{"title":"Checking a plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(againstDirectory:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"],"anchor":"Checking-a-plan"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplans"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlanDifference":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"TrackingPlanDifference","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlanDifference"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TrackingPlanDifference"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplandifference","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One way the plan an app’s events make now differs from the plan committed before them, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" reports it."}]},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/init()":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The plan of every event the program declares with "},{"code":"@Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and of the library’s own, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an error naming the first rule they break."}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/init()","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/init()","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A9PlanErrorO","text":"TrackingPlanError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"init()","kind":"symbol"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/init(schemas:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The plan of the events "},{"code":"schemas","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" describe, in any order, or an error naming the first rule"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they break."}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/init(schemas:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/init(schemas:)","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"schemas"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventSchemaV","text":"EventSchema"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A9PlanErrorO","text":"TrackingPlanError"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"type":"topic","title":"init(schemas:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/check(against:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/check(against:)","title":"check(against:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"check","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"against","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV","text":"TrackingPlan","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV4FileV","text":"File","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A9PlanCheckO","text":"TrackingPlanCheck","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Compares the plan with "},{"code":"committed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the files of a plan exported before, and reports every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"difference."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/IgluExportError":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"IgluExportError","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"IgluExportError","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"IgluExportError","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/igluexporterror","abstract":[{"text":"Why a tracking plan couldn’t be written as an Iglu registry","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/igluFiles(vendor:registry:carryingForward:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlanError":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplanerror","abstract":[{"text":"Why schemas can’t make a tracking plan.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TrackingPlanError","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanError","title":"TrackingPlanError","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlanError","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlanCheck":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplancheck","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What checking a tracking plan against the committed one found: a match, a committed plan that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is only out of date, or differences that break it."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TrackingPlanCheck","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","title":"TrackingPlanCheck","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlanCheck","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/files(carryingForward:)":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The plan’s files, as "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files"},{"type":"text","text":" lists them, with each event’s document keeping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"properties its document in "},{"code":"committed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", at the same name and version, has that the event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no longer declares: each with its schema there, marked "},{"code":"deprecated: true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The documents in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"committed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" of an event’s earlier versions, below the newest the plan lists, are kept too,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with their examples, byte for byte, and listed in the index."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/files(carryingforward:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files(carryingForward:)","title":"files(carryingForward:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"files","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"carryingForward","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlan","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"File","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV4FileV"},{"text":"]) -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"TrackingPlan","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"File","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV4FileV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}]},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans","title":"TrackingPlans","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Export every event an app tracks as JSON Schema that people and services outside the app can read, and check each change against the plan committed before it."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans","role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The JSON Schema (draft 2020-12) of every event an app tracks: one document per event and an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"index, exported from the events’ ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema"},{"text":" values.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TrackingPlan","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","title":"Trackin